    answer: "Review the invoice, payment method, and supporting reference.\n\nDepending on the workflow, you may:\n\n* Reject the payment.\n* Request correction.\n* Edit the payment reference or amount if you have permission.\n* Mark the payment as disputed.\n* Add a validation note.\n* Ask the branch user to correct the record.\n\nAvoid validating a payment when the amount is unclear.",
